                                                                                                <br/>
                                                <br/>
                                                The following update was added:<br/>
                                                <br/>Amadeus experienced an increase in processing times due to some instances of the Electronic Ticketing Server (ETS) operating in a degraded state, which may have led to timeouts and slow responses for ticketing and payment services across multiple applications, including (but not limited to) Altea Reservation Desktop Web, Amadeus e-Retail Engine, Amadeus Digital Experience Suite, Amadeus Web Services, Altea Customer Management, and Selling Platform Connect.<br/>

<br/>Amadeus investigative teams have determined that a rollback previously executed to resolve an earlier incident may have left few instances of the Electronic Ticketing Server (ETS) in a degraded state. This led to intermittent timeouts affecting a limited number of transactions. To recovered the issue, a recycle and rollback was performed on the affected instances, resulting in full recovery of the incident at 21:18 GMT.<br/>
